  "description": "Rectangular-parallelepiped special case: broad rectangular front face, oblique receding edges, eight labels and all twelve edges. AD/DC/DD1 remain hidden. Modern affine clean-up is not a source pixel measurement and does not assert receding screen angles are spatial right angles. No plane contour, dimension, diagonal, corner dot, right-angle mark or exercise answer is added; the projected BB1/DC crossing is unmarked.",
